        body:
            "The style of its subject matter resembles that of the earliest Surahs revealed at Makkah, but this surah was sent down at a stage when the disbelievers of Makkah were employing all sorts of devices and plans to defeat and frustrate the message of the Qurʾān and Muḥammad (upon whom be Allāh's peace and blessings).",
